\newlabel{fig:DymodeFreqAndDamping}{{6.4}{65}{Resonance behavior of (a) frequency and (b) damping rate of the Dy crossover mode. The blue data points represent the measured values with 1$\sigma $ error bars (in most cases smaller than the symbol size). The red solid curves show the results of a joint fit to frequency and damping based on the model presented in Sec.~\ref {sec:modespectrum}. The red shaded area represents the 95\% confidence band of the fit. \relax }{figure.caption.30}{}}
